405	<div class="container">
406	  <header>
407	    <h1>⚡ Colab Connect</h1>
408	    <p class="subtitle">Google Colab AI Integration · Faust Interface</p>
409	  </header>
410	
411	  <div class="status-badge">
412	    <div class="status-dot" id="statusDot"></div>
413	    <span id="statusText">Not Connected</span>
414	  </div>
415	
416	  <div class="instructions">
417	    <h3>🔐 How to Grant Faust Access</h3>
418	    <ol>
419	      <li>Open your Colab notebook: <code>1iYIe9pNcGO3nFYX2BOVtrLCJoF37PzP6</code></li>
420	      <li>Click <strong>Share</strong> in the top-right corner</li>
421	      <li>Add service account email: <code>faust-colab@PROJECT_ID.iam.gserviceaccount.com</code></li>
422	      <li>Set permission to <strong>Editor</strong> or <strong>Viewer</strong></li>
423	      <li>Paste service account JSON in Settings below</li>
